            "review_title": "Review at The Moss Bar - Speakeasy Bar",
            "review_text": "clogs23\nNottingham, United Kingdom146 contributions\n0\nLOVE\nAug 2025 • Couples\nLoved this bar.\n\nGoing through the vending machine to find it added to the experience.\n\nOne of the bar staff asked what we liked and gave recommendations - they didnt disappoint! \n\nThe cocktails were a work of art and tasted delicious. \n\nYou pay more for cocktails here but the experience was well worth it\nRead more\nWritten August 10, 2025",
